    "Description": "firewalld is a firewall service daemon that provides a dynamic customizable firewall with a D-Bus interface.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* firewalld: firewalld: Local unprivileged user can modify firewall state due to D-Bus setter mis-authorization (CVE-2026-4948)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
